(7735945, 1275151, 103142, '<td valign="top">So incredibly beautiful!! Well captured! Be a bit careful with the topaz sharpening and the neural blur -- it can begin to look a little too perfect and end up looking a tad fake. Sometimes before doing the topaz, etc., I''ll merge it together, then do the adjustments, and then just reduce the opacity of those adjustments to let a little bit of grain, etc., in. Just a thought! But Huge, HUGE congrats on a well deserved blue!<br/></td>', 'So incredibly beautiful!! Well captured! Be a bit careful with the topaz sharpening and the neural blur -- it can begin to look a little too perfect and end up looking a tad fake. Sometimes before doing the topaz, etc., I''ll merge it together, then do the adjustments, and then just reduce the opacity of those adjustments to let a little bit of grain, etc., in. Just a thought! But Huge, HUGE congrats on a well deserved blue!', '2023-01-02 12:36:36.000000', NULL, 0),
