(7736062, 1275152, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is truly amazing -- I''m incredibly jealous and wish I took this shot! What a piece of art! (haha!! Now that I''m reading the comments, I''m not the first to say it! But I''m leaving the comment anyway, because it really is ART!</td>', 'This is truly amazing -- I''m incredibly jealous and wish I took this shot! What a piece of art! (haha!! Now that I''m reading the comments, I''m not the first to say it! But I''m leaving the comment anyway, because it really is ART!', '2023-01-03 21:59:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7736143, 1275180, 141319, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> the beautiful Flumi .. I''m sorry I meant to comment on this superb action shot in voting but got waylaid .. <br/> <br/>I''m really in awe of your abilities .. catching a dog running towards you and totally nailing the focus .. <br/>for me that would be an absolute miracle .. <br/> <br/>so seeing this gorgeous girl .. in the zone .. like her mum ..  definitely looks like a match made in heaven .. <br/> <br/>congrats on the ribbon .. <br/>wonderful .. :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you Roz, you are so generous with your praise. I promise it was not the only shot I took to get this picture :-). And I am so lucky to have willing participants. <br/> <br/>I tell you what, we do 2 workshops - you come and I teach you what I know about dog photography, but you teach ME your awesome insect photography :-) - Deal?</td>', 'Originally posted by roz: the beautiful Flumi .. I''m sorry I meant to comment on this superb action shot in voting but got waylaid ..  I''m really in awe of your abilities .. catching a dog running towards you and totally nailing the focus .. for me that would be an absolute miracle ..  so seeing this gorgeous girl .. in the zone .. like her mum ..  definitely looks like a match made in heaven ..  congrats on the ribbon .. wonderful .. :)   Thank you Roz, you are so generous with your praise. I promise it was not the only shot I took to get this picture :-). And I am so lucky to have willing participants.  I tell you what, we do 2 workshops - you come and I teach you what I know about dog photography, but you teach ME your awesome insect photography :-) - Deal?', '2023-01-06 00:44:44.000000', NULL, 0);
